    "section": "1.52",
    "heading": "Carrying Objects",
    "lineStart": 469,
    "lineEnd": 471
  },
  "section": "1.52",
  "rulesText": "You can usually carry your gear and treasure without worrying about the weight of those objects. If you try to haul an unusually heavy object or a massive number of lighter objects, the GM might require you to abide by the rules for carrying capacity in \"Rules Glossary.\""
}
